OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMany places will have a dry and
OL,6,Fcold day with plenty of sunshine.
OL,7,FCloudier at times this morning across
OL,8,Feastern Borders with the odd light
OL,9,Fshower.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry and
OL,12,Fclear. Then the rest of the night will
OL,13,Fbe dry with lengthy clear periods and
OL,14,Fa widespread sharp frost.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FAfter a frosty start all
OL,17,Fparts will have a dry, cold and sunny
OL,18,Fday. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
